name: "LAB ONLY: unpinned action anti-pattern"

# Anti-pattern (illustrative only, DO NOT ENABLE):
# steps:
#   - uses: third-party/example-action@v1
#   - run: echo "Tag-based references can move unexpectedly"

# Safer pattern guidance:
# - Pin third-party actions to full commit SHA.
# - Example:
#   uses: third-party/example-action@0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567
# - Review and rotate pins on a controlled cadence.
